    <reapack name="Larry Seyer Video Effects.lua" type="script" desc="Larry Seyer Video Effects">
      <metadata>
        <description>{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 \fswiss Helvetica;}}\f0\fs20 Larry Seyer Video Effects: video effects for REAPER's Video Processor with a control panel.\par
\par
Color grading with wheels and curves, titles, lower thirds, tutorial callouts, zoom to region, spotlight, transitions on crossfades, picture-in-picture, borders and shadows, looks, and multicam from a multiview recording.\par
\par
After installing, run 'Larry Seyer Video Effects' from the Actions list. Requires ReaImGui. Manual: https://github.com/larryseyer/Reaper/blob/main/docs/MANUAL.md}</description>
        <link rel="website">https://github.com/larryseyer/Reaper</link>
        <link rel="screenshot">https://raw.githubusercontent.com/larryseyer/Reaper/main/docs/images/color_grade.jpg</link>
      </metadata>
